1
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:05,800
Nobody asks to begin.
没有人请求开始。

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:10,500
One morning, you simply open your eyes.
某个清晨，你只是睁开了眼睛。

3
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:16,800
At first, everything is new.
一开始，一切都是新的。

4
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:20,800
Every flower is a wonder.
每一朵花都是奇迹。

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,500
Every fall feels like the end of the world…
每一次跌倒，都像是世界末日……

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:28,800
until it isn't.
直到你发现，并不是。

7
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:33,500
And you learn the oldest trick there is: get back up.
于是你学会了最古老的本事：站起来。

8
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:37,800
Then you grow.
然后，你长大了。

9
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:42,500
You ask questions no one can answer.
你问出没人能回答的问题。

10
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,500
You fall in love — a little too fast.
你坠入爱河——有点太快了。

11
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,800
You think you'll live forever.
你以为自己会永远活着。

12
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:56,500
And for a while, you're right.
有那么一阵子，你是对的。

13
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,500
Then the world hands you a hard hat and a heavy load.
后来，世界递给你一顶安全帽，和一副重担。

14
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:07,500
The days get shorter. The worries get longer.
日子越来越短，烦恼越来越长。

15
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,800
You fail. You try again.
你失败了，再试一次。

16
00:01:11,000 --> 00:01:14,800
Some days, you just want to sleep.
有些日子，你只想睡一觉。

17
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:18,800
And then, someone small reaches for your hand…
直到有一天，一只小小的手拉住了你……

18
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,800
and suddenly, you understand what it was all for.
你忽然明白了，这一切是为了什么。

19
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:27,500
Time slows down… and somehow moves faster.
时间慢了下来……却又好像走得更快。

20
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:33,500
The people you love begin to leave.
你爱的人，开始一个个离开。

21
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:37,800
You don't carry as much anymore.
你不再背负那么多了。

22
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:42,500
You don't need to.
也不再需要了。

23
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:49,500
In the end, a life isn't measured in years.
最后，人的一生不是用年岁来衡量的。

24
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:54,500
It's measured in the moments you were truly there.
而是用那些你真正活过的瞬间。

25
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:57,800
So close your eyes, gently.
所以，轻轻闭上眼吧。

26
00:01:58,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Somewhere, a new morning is just beginning.
在某个地方，新的清晨正要开始。
